  "content": "<p><strong>Description:</strong> This lecture by Prof. Ernest Fraenkel is on protein interaction networks. He covers network models, including their structure and an analysis. He asks, &ldquo;can we use networks to predict function?&rdquo; He ends with a data integration example.</p>\n<p><strong>Instructor:</strong> Prof. Ernest Fraenkel</p>\n",
